<SubSection title="What is Biodesign?" id="What is Biodesign?">
<p>Biodesign is the process by which engineers, designers, and stakeholders iterate through solutions to medical and healthcare problems. The "Student Guide to Biodesign" was developed at Stanford University and provides step-by-step guides for how to progress through the biodesign process. Visit "LINK" for these resources. </p>
